  "description": "Redevelopment of site. Erection of two, four, seven and nine-storey high buildings to provide mixed use. 1no. one commercial unit (Use Class E) at ground floor level and 96no. residential units with associated car and cycle parking, parking landscaping, refuse / recycling storage, plant, and other associated works. (Summary).",
